      "sourceText": "> `std::atomic_flag` 是一个原子的“占用标志”。`test_and_set()` 会原子地读取旧值并把标志设置为 `true`，因此可以用它实现最简单的自旋锁；没有抢到锁的线程会不断循环检查，这种行为就叫自旋。",
      "translatedText": "> `std::atomic_flag` is an atomic “occupancy flag”\\.`test_and_set()` atomically reads the old value and sets the flag to `true`, so it can be used to implement the simplest spinlock; a thread that fails to acquire the lock will keep looping to check, and this behavior is called spinning\\.",
