      "translatedText": "Another confirmed source code gap is initialization protection: the point cloud callback does not check whether the initial TF succeeded and directly uses the cache\\. The container's `tf2::Transform` default constructor does not initialize values, and the node also does not first set the cache to an identity transform\\. If the point cloud arrives first, or the initial TF query keeps failing, an uninitialized matrix may be used; the runtime behavior after triggering was not tested in this round\\.",
